{"id":"n76992-1-10","stage":2,"title":"주유소 · 加油站","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n76992-1-10-1","ko":"큰일이야. 자동차에 기름이 거의 다 떨어졌어.","zh":"糟了，车里的油快用完了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"큰일이야.","meaning":"大事","explanation":"큰일：大事；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"큰일","audio":"/audio/dbfb08997ec518d3dc88.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72174","senseId":"2","lemma":"큰일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"큰일이야","audio":"/audio/e042f6160a32bc16205d.mp3"}},{"text":"자동차에","meaning":"汽车","explanation":"자동차：汽车；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"자동차","audio":"/audio/716907a2f49c42607a15.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70799","senseId":"1","lemma":"자동차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자동차에","audio":"/audio/a72dddf218e5b88acb97.mp3"}},{"text":"기름이","meaning":"油","explanation":"기름：油；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"기름","audio":"/audio/14b26cab577adc333256.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40022","senseId":"2","lemma":"기름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기름이","audio":"/audio/09f29466e5d322121a56.mp3"}},{"text":"거의","meaning":"几乎，快要","explanation":"거의：几乎，快要","readings":[{"term":"거의","audio":"/audio/1b1da423b101b5518eb2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60090","senseId":"2","lemma":"거의","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거의","audio":"/audio/1b1da423b101b5518eb2.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全、都","explanation":"다：全、都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58176","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"떨어졌어.","meaning":"不足，短缺，耗尽","explanation":"떨어지다：不足，短缺，耗尽；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"떨어지다","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89796","senseId":"19","lemma":"떨어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"떨어졌어","audio":"/audio/04c43ebe2660e53e7f9b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"dbfb08997ec518d3","term":"큰일","zh":"大事","audio":"/audio/dbfb08997ec518d3dc88.mp3","entryId":"72174","definition":"无法挽回的大事故或不好的事情。","pronunciation":["크닐"]},{"id":"716907a2f49c4260","term":"자동차","zh":"汽车","audio":"/audio/716907a2f49c42607a15.mp3","entryId":"70799","definition":"用引擎的力量转动轮胎，在道路上行驶的车。","pronunciation":["자동차"]},{"id":"14b26cab577adc33","term":"기름","zh":"油","audio":"/audio/14b26cab577adc333256.mp3","entryId":"40022","definition":"从地下开采，主要用于汽车或工厂燃料的黑色液体。","pronunciation":["기름"]},{"id":"1b1da423b101b551","term":"거의","zh":"几乎，快要","audio":"/audio/1b1da423b101b5518eb2.mp3","entryId":"60090","definition":"离某个状态或限度很近。","pronunciation":["거의","거이"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全、都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58176","definition":"全、都","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"5360fef914150d39","term":"떨어지다","zh":"不足，短缺，耗尽","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3","entryId":"89796","definition":"没进行补充，所以现在没有剩余。","pronunciation":["떠러지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ffef78c34a3464887d45.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n76992-1-10-2","ko":"여기서 제일 가까운 주유소가 어디에 있는지 물어보자.","zh":"我们问问这里最近的加油站在哪里吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기서","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；서：에서 的缩略，表示动作地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기서","audio":"/audio/507960116aed3699ca8f.mp3"}},{"text":"제일","meaning":"最","explanation":"제일：最","readings":[{"term":"제일","audio":"/audio/c181b2319e3ac556998a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92032","senseId":"1","lemma":"제일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제일","audio":"/audio/c181b2319e3ac556998a.mp3"}},{"text":"가까운","meaning":"近","explanation":"가깝다：近；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"가깝다","audio":"/audio/9ff63e71387c2c60a305.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65200","senseId":"1","lemma":"가깝다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가까운","audio":"/audio/ae733feeb8d75aeaad68.mp3"}},{"text":"주유소가","meaning":"加油站","explanation":"주유소：加油站；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"주유소","audio":"/audio/dd9e5842a0fb47ea92a5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"76992","senseId":"1","lemma":"주유소","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주유소가","audio":"/audio/27f5fdfa1469fb405729.mp3"}},{"text":"어디에","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디에","audio":"/audio/c24ae324e24a5ebc5c5e.mp3"}},{"text":"있는지","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는지","audio":"/audio/7df109195b78bcf9f45d.mp3"}},{"text":"물어보자.","meaning":"问问看、打听一下","explanation":"묻다 在这里是问，不是埋藏；ㄷ 不规则活用使 묻 + 어 变为 물어。-아/어 보다 表试着，-자 是一起做的提议。","readings":[{"term":"묻다","audio":"/audio/ed5c4f65f9f1771c348e.mp3"},{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69471","senseId":"1","lemma":"묻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물어보자","audio":"/audio/6e3d50c35364552e188b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"c181b2319e3ac556","term":"제일","zh":"最","audio":"/audio/c181b2319e3ac556998a.mp3","entryId":"92032","definition":"在多个对象中首屈一指地。","pronunciation":["제ː일"]},{"id":"9ff63e71387c2c60","term":"가깝다","zh":"近","audio":"/audio/9ff63e71387c2c60a305.mp3","entryId":"65200","definition":"离某个地方不远。","pronunciation":["가깝따"]},{"id":"dd9e5842a0fb47ea","term":"주유소","zh":"加油站","audio":"/audio/dd9e5842a0fb47ea92a5.mp3","entryId":"76992","definition":"往汽车等里添加燃料油的地方。","pronunciation":["주ː유소"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"ed5c4f65f9f1771c","term":"묻다","zh":"问、询问","audio":"/audio/ed5c4f65f9f1771c348e.mp3","entryId":"69471","definition":"问、询问","pronunciation":["묻ː따"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试，试图","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试，试图","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/46d94f65675e0cbc7801.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.717,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=76992","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":86,"sequenceScore":2.3704,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我们问问这里最近的加油站在哪里吧。","糟了，车里的油快用完了。","智秀当时确实在家吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["糟了，车里的油快用完了。","智秀当时确实在家吗？","我们问问这里最近的加油站在哪里吧。"],"answer":2}]}
